dsh-connections includes adapted portions of DeepSeek Harness:

  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar 0.2.1-rc.5
    Local sidebar factory; navigation injection and stylesheet ownership adapted.
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings 0.2.1-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.1-rc.5
    Remote settings factory; ConfigForms accessor adapted for local preferences.
  @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-account 0.2.1-rc.2 / 0.2.1-rc.3 / 0.2.1-rc.5
    Remote account factory; browser capabilities and stylesheet ownership adapted.

