Adapters: scripts/native-sidebar.mjs, scripts/native-settings.mjs,
scripts/native-account.mjs. The shortcut adapter observes the installed native
registry; it does not include or replace the native shortcut provider.

dist/native-inputs.json records exact native input versions and SHA-512 digests
for reproducible maintenance review. These private adapters require review when
their upstream inputs change; the manifest does not grant future compatibility.
